'''NEO First Errand''' (絶・はじめてのお遣い, ''Zetsu ・ Hajimete no Otsukai'', '''Absolute • First Errand''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]] and appears on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''', and '''24th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Baby Fake (Merciless)|First Errand]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Bakery Cat]] - Fried Chicken Cat.

